{"ID":"20240206091458-ms1jqr0","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206091458-ms1jqr0","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091458-ms1jqr0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091506-wfdhndr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091501-e2snje8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206091506-wfdhndr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:129,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:129\u0026#125;","title":"千年健","type":"doc","updated":"20240830161627"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206091506-wfdhndr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091506-wfdhndr","updated":"20240206091510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产云南、广西等地。\n【性状】\t根茎圆柱形或略扁稍弯曲。长1540cm，直径0.82cm。表面红棕色或黄棕色，粗糙，有多数扭曲的纵沟纹及黄白色的纤维束。质脆，易折断，折断面红褐色，有很多纤维束外露，纤维群散在，具圆形光泽的油点。气芳香，味辛、微苦。\n【性味】\t苦、辛，温。\n【功效】\t祛风湿、舒筋活络、止痛、消肿等功效。主治风湿痹痛、肢节酸育、筋骨痿软、跌打损伤、胃痛、痈疽疮肿等。\n【注解】\t“一包针”：指千年健药材内有许多黄色的纤维束，折断后纤维束多而明显，参差不齐，外露如针。"}]},{"ID":"20240206091501-e2snje8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206091501-e2snje8","updated":"20240206091501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206091501-rhbvzoz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710133506-z4fjpel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710133506-z4fjpel","updated":"20240710134113"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 433px;","style":"width: 423px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"千年健"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/千年健-20240710133719-iggjyge.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 423px;\" parent-style=\"width: 433px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 450px;","style":"width: 440px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"千年健 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/千年健 1-20240710134113-7ntywvo.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 440px;\" parent-style=\"width: 450px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830161448-qi5fm6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161448-qi5fm6f","updated":"20240830161542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 596px;","style":"width: 586px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"千年健"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/千年健-20240830161448-jobgjx1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 586px;\" parent-style=\"width: 596px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 488px;","style":"width: 478px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"千年健 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/千年健 1-20240830161542-hi7dyd2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 478px;\" parent-style=\"width: 488px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710134343-jqiuzpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710134343-jqiuzpm","updated":"20240830161346"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 597px;","style":"width: 587px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"千年健 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/千年健 3-20240710134343-5f9j31r.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 587px;\" parent-style=\"width: 597px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 455px;","style":"width: 445px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"千年健 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/千年健 6-20240710135916-pp0ejsf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 445px;\" parent-style=\"width: 455px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710134820-eo0ho5y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710134820-eo0ho5y","updated":"20240830161347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 697px;","style":"width: 687px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"千年健 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/千年健 4-20240710134820-rmz7snv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 687px;\" parent-style=\"width: 697px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240710135431-yv1pl0y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240710135431-yv1pl0y"}},{"ID":"20240830161620-4e83idd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-4e83idd","updated":"20240830161627"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：千年健"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-m8ajywm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-m8ajywm","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"千年健《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-vek3tku","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-vek3tku","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】QiānNiánJiàn"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-ucwllci","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-ucwllci","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】RHIZOMAHOMALOMENAE"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-c2uged8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-c2uged8","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】一包针、千颗针、千年见、丝棱线"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-nsymclx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-nsymclx","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为天南星科平丝芋属植物千年健Homalomenaocculta（Lour.）Schott的干燥根茎。春、秋二季采挖，洗净，除去外皮，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-rce0gw2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-rce0gw2","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品呈圆柱形，稍弯曲，有的略扁，长15～40cm，直径0。8～1。5cm。表面黄棕色至红棕色，粗糙，可见多数扭曲的纵沟纹、圆形根痕及黄色针状纤维束。质硬而脆，断面红褐色，黄色针状纤维束多而明显，相对另一断面呈多数针眼状小孔及有少数黄色针状纤维束，可见深褐色具光泽的油点。气香，味辛、微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-70i3qma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-70i3qma","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-fvtkkmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-fvtkkmy","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）本品横切面：木栓细胞有的残存，棕色。基本组织中散有大的分泌腔，由数层木栓细胞组成；分泌细胞靠外侧较多，内含黄色至棕色分泌物；黏液细胞较大，内含草酸钙针晶束；草酸钙簇晶散在；维管束外韧型及周木型，散列，外韧型维管束外侧常伴有纤维束，单一纤维束少见，纤维壁较厚，木化。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-fud959n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-fud959n","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末1g，加乙醚5ml，放置30钟，时时振摇，滤过，取滤液1ml，置蒸发皿中，挥去乙醚，残渣加1％香草醛硫酸溶液1～2滴，显紫红色或紫色。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-ov0jm24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-ov0jm24","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】除去杂质，洗净，润透，切片，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-wo7icgu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-wo7icgu","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】苦，辛，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-c3u94xr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-c3u94xr","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肝、肾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-fgrg4h5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-fgrg4h5","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】祛风湿，健筋骨，活血止痛。用于风寒湿痹，腰膝冷痛，下肢拘挛麻木。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-k4oddz1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-k4oddz1","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】4.5～9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-n6crm66","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-n6crm66","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】阴虚内热者忌用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-t9yn4gz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-t9yn4gz","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置阴凉干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-vtssva5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-vtssva5","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【备注】（1）用于风湿痹痛、腰酸脚软、手足拘挛麻痹等症，常与桑寄生、虎骨、牛膝等配合应用。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-nkfsp6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-nkfsp6m","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-mv45502","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-mv45502","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"千年健《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-75f2ljw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-75f2ljw","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《纲目拾遗》"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-pnohnht","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-pnohnht","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】QiānNiánJiàn"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-83tdvt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-83tdvt7","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】一包针（《中药志》），千年见（《药材资料汇编》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-fq7t4mj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-fq7t4mj","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为天南星科植物千年健的根茎。全年可采，以秋采者品质较佳。挖取后，洗净泥土，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-rrknnv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-rrknnv5","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】多年生草本。根茎肉质，绿色，细长，直径1～2厘米，粗糙。叶互生；具长柄，柄长18～25厘米，肉质，绿色，平滑无毛，基部扩大成淡黄色叶鞘，包着根茎，叶鞘长约3～5厘米，脱落或宿存；叶片卵状箭形，长11～15厘米，宽7～11厘米，先端渐尖，基部箭形而圆，开展，全缘，表面绿色，背面淡绿色，两面平滑无毛，侧脉平行向上斜升，干后呈有规则的皱缩。花为肉穗花序；佛焰苞管部宿存，片部脱落；花单性，无花被。果实为浆果。花期3～4月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-fbzvd7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-fbzvd7u","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生于林中水沟附近的阴湿地。分布广西、云南。产广西南部。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-qrt2ep8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-qrt2ep8","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】干燥根茎呈长圆柱形，弯曲，长短不等，通常长约40厘米，直径6～8毫米，棕红色或棕黄色，表面粗糙，有多数扭曲的深纵沟纹及黄白色的针状突出物，沟纹成层排列，每层长约1.5厘米，末端即成针刺突出。质脆，易折断，折断面不平，树脂样，有很多粗韧的针状纤维群，并散布去除纤维后所留下的针眼状小孔。横切面淡棕色至棕红色，纤维群成黄色点状散列。气芳香，久闻有不悦感，味微辛辣。以棕红色、条祖、香浓者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-2dkq694","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-2dkq694","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】含挥发油，其中有α-蒎烯、β-蒎烯、芳樟醇等。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-lyj3yuv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-lyj3yuv","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-2sag17p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-2sag17p","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-5zoonev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-5zoonev","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草再新》：\"味苦，性寒，有小毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-dkfziwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-dkfziwl","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草求原》：\"辛，温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-uvgoafe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-uvgoafe","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药材资料汇编》：\"苦，温，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-k6yi9wd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-k6yi9wd","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-986isn6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-986isn6","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草再新》：\"入肝、肺二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-6ubzpzt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-6ubzpzt","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药材学》：\"入肝、肾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-khw8rcq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-khw8rcq","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-w2w11wk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-w2w11wk","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"祛风湿，壮筋骨，止痛，消肿。治风湿痹痛，肢节酸痛，筋骨痿软，胃痛，痈疽疮肿。用于风湿痹痛、腰膝冷痛、下肢拘挛麻木。本品能祛风湿，强盘骨。以本品与钻地风、虎骨、牛膝、枸杞子等浸酒服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-7edysk5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-7edysk5","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《柑园小识》：\"可入药酒，风气痛老人最宜。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-eflbj1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-eflbj1u","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目拾遗》：\"壮筋骨，浸酒；止胃痛，酒磨服。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-382mm0p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-382mm0p","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草再新》，\"治痈痿疮疽，杀虫败毒，消肿排脓。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-wu3xhgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-wu3xhgo","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《饮片新参》：\"入血分，祛风湿痹痛，强筋骨，治肢节酸疼。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-o88t8y9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-o88t8y9","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《中药材手册》：\"治风气痛，筋骨痪软，半身不遂。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-q32f8cg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-q32f8cg","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1.5～3钱；或浸酒。外用：研末调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-0qopjel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-0qopjel","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-pbt1hh3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-pbt1hh3","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《柑园小识》：\"忌莱菔。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-82zuknb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-82zuknb","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《饮片新参》：\"阴虚内热者慎用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-7vjxe8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-7vjxe8v","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-lofod9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-lofod9k","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"千年健《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-kthe058","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-kthe058","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《本草纲目拾遗》"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-pdeom4o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-pdeom4o","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】QiānNiánJiàn"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-zegmk6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-zegmk6f","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】ObscuredHomalomenaRhizome,RhizomeofObscuredHomalomena"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-r1mmbid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-r1mmbid","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】一包针、千年见、千颗针、丝棱线"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-om1xtwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-om1xtwf","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-4kf134s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-4kf134s","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为天南星科植物千年健的根茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-8v657s2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-8v657s2","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Homalomenaocculta(Lour.)Schott[CallaoccultaLour.;H.cohinchinensisEngl.H.tonkinensisEngl.]"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-vvlatac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-vvlatac","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋、冬季采收，割下根茎，削去茎尖、须根，洗净泥土，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-lidx3fr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-lidx3fr","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】千年健，多年生草本。根茎匍匐，细长，粗1.5cm。根肉质，密被淡褐色短绒毛，须根纤维状。常具高30-50cm的直立的地茎。鳃叶线状披针形，长达16cm，基部宽2.5cm，向上渐狭，锐尖；叶柄长20-40cm，下部具宽3-5mm的鞘；叶片膜质至纸质，箭状心形至心形，长15-30cm，宽10-28cm，先端骤狭渐尖；侧脉平行向上斜升。花序1-3，生鳞叶之腑，花序柄短于叶柄；佛焰苞绿白色，长圆形至椭圆形，长5-6.5cm，花前度卷成纹锤形，盛花时上部略展开成短舟状；肉穗花序长3-5cm；雌花序长1-1.5cm，粗4-5mm；雄花序长2-3cm，粗3-4mm；子房长圆形，基部一侧具假雄蕊1，子房3室。浆果，种子褐色，长圆形。花期7-9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-7ll65c5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-7ll65c5","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-80vvtdq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-80vvtdq","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生于海拔80-1100m的沟谷密林下、笔林和山坡灌丛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-989viyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-989viyy","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于广东、海南、广西云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-wc6vak1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-wc6vak1","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-oeexj03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-oeexj03","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性，喜温暖阴湿气候，不耐寒，忌强光。宜选择肥沃、疏松的砂质壤土栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-t30jgr5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-t30jgr5","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术繁殖方法：用扦插繁殖法。扦插育苗移栽，于春、夏季，选择健壮根茎或茎段剪成长5cm、带2-3个芽眼的小段，按行株距15cm×2cm埋植，覆土约5cm，浇水保湿。培育2-3个月，插条长出数条须根，苗高10-15cm，按行株距25cm×20cm开穴定植。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-4ka745w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-4ka745w","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理，定植成活后，每年中耕除草3-4次，追肥2-3次。干旱时及时浇水保湿，无萌蔽条件时须搭架遮荫，调节荫蔽度至70%-80%。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-ysr59fl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-ysr59fl","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病虫害防治，叶斑病，7-8月高温多雨季易发生，为害叶片。可用退菌特1000倍液喷酒叶面防治。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-337dkxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-337dkxo","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-hkyzs47","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-hkyzs47","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别根茎圆柱形或略扁稍弯曲。长15-40cm，直径0.8-2Cm。表面红棕色或黄棕色，粗糙，有多数扭曲的纵沟纹及黄白色的纤维束。质脆，易折断，折断面红棕色，树脂作，有很多纤维束外露及圆形具光泽的油点。气芳香，味辛、微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-damwqhu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-damwqhu","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别根茎横切面：木柱层常已除去。薄壁组织细胞内多含红棕色或浅棕色块状物，并含较多的草酸钙簇晶及少数外晶束。维管束散在，外韧型或周木型，外韧型者大多数有大的韧皮纤维束，淡黄色，壁厚，木化，有的具纹孔。油室众多，大型，直径180-375um，周围细胞壁木柱化，4-5层。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-beas8km","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-beas8km","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】千年健含约0.69%的挥发油，被鉴定的成分有α-蒎烯(α-pinene)，β-蒎烯(β-pinene)柠檬烯(limonene)，芳樟醇(linalool)，α-松油醇(α-terpineol)，橙花醇(nerol)，香叶醇(geraniol)，丁香油酚(eugenol)，香叶醛(geranial)，β-松油醇(β-terpineol)，异龙脑(isoborneol)，松油烯-4-醇(terpinen-4-ol)，文藿香醇(patchoulialcohol)。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-vfwx508","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-vfwx508","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】抑菌作用用滤纸片平板法试验表明千年健挥发油具有显着抑制布氏杆菌（牛544，羊16、猪1330型）在平板上生长。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-e65pe1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-e65pe1h","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】理化鉴别（1）取粉末1g，加乙醚5ml冷浸，滤过，取滤液1ml，置蒸发皿中，待乙醚挥散后，加5%香草醛浓硫酸溶液1滴，显终紫色。（检查千年健挥发油）（2）薄层色谱取粉末50-100g，于挥发油提取器内提取其挥发油。吸取挥发油加等量的乙酸乙酯稀释后作供试品溶液，另取芳香醇a-菠烯和B-菠烯制成对照品溶液。分别吸取供试品和对照品溶液点于同一硅胶G薄层板上，用己烷-乙酸乙酯（85：15）展开，展距15cm。用5%香草醛浓硫酸试液，显色，供试品和对照品在相应的位置上显相同颜色的斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-csaarnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-csaarnd","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】拣净杂质，用水稍浸，捞出润透，切片晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-apmuihg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-apmuihg","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味苦；辛；性温；小毒"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-zr8xduu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-zr8xduu","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】肝；肾；胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-9ocs6bd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-9ocs6bd","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】祛风湿；舒筋活络；止痛；消肿。主风湿痹痛；肢节酸育；筋骨痿软；跌打损伤；胃痛；痈疽疮肿"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-itoajs5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-itoajs5","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，9-15g；或浸酒。外用：适量，研末，调敷。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-vyaf7go","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-vyaf7go","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】阴虚内热者慎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-ga128uq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-ga128uq","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】1.《本草正义》：千年健，今恒用之于宣通经络，祛风逐痹，颇有应验。盖气味皆厚，亦辛温走窜之作用也。2.《柑园小识》：可入药酒，风气痛老人最宜。3.《纲目拾遗》：壮筋骨，浸酒；止胃痛，酒磨服。4.《本草再新》：治痈瘘疮疽，杀虫败毒，消肿排脓。5.《饮片新参》：入血分，祛风湿痹痛，强筋骨，治肢节酸疼。6.《中药材手册》：治风气痛，筋骨瘘软，半身不遂。"}]},{"ID":"20240830161620-104i859","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161620-104i859","updated":"20240830161636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830161621-eabj4nn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830161621-eabj4nn","updated":"20240830161636"}},{"ID":"20240830161622-gt9mlgo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830161622-gt9mlgo","updated":"20240830161636"}}]}